{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T05:23:03.248Z","ordinal":38499,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac485ae35dc87d09b2e6b55b681c670","status":"completed","call_id":"call_a2o6i3RkMoGJ4XqclX8Wk3kX","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport subprocess,json\\nhead=Path('/private/tmp/dev75-domain-closeout-final-head.txt').read_text().strip();assert subprocess.check_output(['git','rev-parse','HEAD']).decode().strip()==head\\nbody='''`CalculationError.cause` now uses the canonical nested Option type and a missing-key default while retaining the four original encoded forms: missing, explicit undefined, null and opaque value. Calculator catalogue entries expose their checked `calculate` continuation; the unused generic `program` field is removed, while rule-owned programs remain available.\\n\\nCore and genuine installed-package checks cover the original keys, bytes and hashes, constructor defaults, and removal of the unused capability. Owning READMEs, calculator/API architecture, public error guidance, four major package Changesets and a content patch change together. Tax algorithms, saved results, source artifacts and OpenAPI stay unchanged.\\n\\nValidation: all nine local CI-mode stages pass on corrected #151 in 916.14 seconds. This includes 32 workflow tests, 512 lint tests, 66 Core, 52 rule, 37 calculator, 62 API app, 58 SDK, 17 HTTP and 217 RPC tests, plus seven built native app cases. Two deliberate removals fail at the owning Core test and genuine installed-consumer compiler. All 21 frozen source files are restored exactly; nine native artifact inventories and four unchanged screenshots are recorded. The earlier local pass and original #151 Linux import failure remain separate evidence. Fresh hosted checks remain pending.\\n\\n'''+f'[Dated proof](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/{head}/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-06-domain-contract-closeout.json). This draft follows corrected #151. T004 remains active for trusted native rate identity/limits; DEV-76–81 and the unresolved Medicare decision remain separate work. No merge, publication, deployment or provider operation is included.\\\\n'\\nPath('/private/tmp/dev75-domain-closeout-pr-body.md').write_text(body)\\nexisting=json.loads(subprocess.check_output(['gh','pr','list','--head','codex/dev-75-domain-contract-closeout','--state','all','--json','url,number']));assert not existing,existing\\nr=subprocess.run(['gh','pr','create','--draft','--base','codex/dev-75-request-absence-owners','--head','codex/dev-75-domain-contract-closeout','--title','Preserve error forms and remove unused catalogue program','--body-file','/private/tmp/dev75-domain-closeout-pr-body.md'],check=True,capture_output=True,text=True);url=r.stdout.strip();Path('/private/tmp/dev75-domain-closeout-pr-url.txt').write_text(url+'\\\\n');print(url)\\nPY\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1300}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10e2a-6616-7a42-8b17-50e4af22487f","create_time":1791264167.041587}}}
