{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T05:31:32.308Z","ordinal":38646,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac487951afc87d09bd3e0e741367361","status":"completed","call_id":"call_wH7cKGvneVeegdx6gSuiFjLn","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\np=Path('docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md')\\np.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\\\n\\\\nShared rate-limit implementation starts from clean draft #152 head\\\\n0a8b823685a2a4aa453f8a4bccd624f4be976931 on\\\\ncodex/dev-75-shared-rate-limits. Draft #151 corrective head 0d83692f passes\\\\nGitHub Quality run 37416691591/job 112116757973 at 05:26:07Z; #152 run\\\\n37418263663 remains running at the 05:29Z readback. The approved #146 DEV-75\\\\ncomment is already saved as 6a17034d-46f9-4450-821e-d5534c34df7c; no duplicate\\\\ncomment is posted. T004 stays active.\\\\n\\\\nDocumentation impact before implementation: Change required for calculator\\\\nrate Schemas/service/export and README; HTTP errors/OpenAPI source and generated\\\\nsnapshot; RPC errors/revision/consumers and README; API/Website host/private\\\\nbinding config and READMEs; native infrastructure graph/namespace configuration\\\\nand owning operational runbook; API/SDK, Effect and frontend architecture;\\\\npublic limits/error guidance; package Changesets; active SPEC/tasks and dated\\\\nproof. Regenerate OpenAPI through its owning test command. Preserve tax\\\\nalgorithms, source/table/report oracles, lockfile, tool versions, standards,\\\\nCI, skill assets, agent instructions and external authority. Root topology\\\\nchanges are N/A because existing packages continue to own the work. Native\\\\nfixtures and packed/browser consumers must prove the whole shared allowance,\\\\nmetadata independence, checked failures and privacy before acceptance.\\\\n\\\\nThe native host alone adds rate admission below its existing bounded service.\\\\nPublic HTTP/RPC and binding-only Website calls share 60 calculations per minute\\\\nper checked redacted connection key; each batch member consumes one unit.\\\\nMissing/invalid/forwarded identity fails safely; metadata consumes no unit.\\\\nRequired checked CALCULATOR_RATE_NAMESPACE has no fallback or chosen Production\\\\nvalue. Local native fixtures use isolated explicit values with Alchemy's own\\\\npacking. Provider namespace uniqueness and real edge identity remain separate\\\\npre-apply readback. No provider apply, publication or Medicare correction is\\\\nauthorised. This is implementation intent, not accepted runtime proof.\\\\n''')\\nPY\",max_output_tokens:500}));\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/packages/calculators/src/schemas.ts\\n@@\\n-export const CalculatorRequestError = Schema.Union([\\n+export class CalculatorRateLimited extends Schema.TaggedError<CalculatorRateLimited>()(\\n+  \\\"CalculatorRateLimited\\\",\\n+  {\\n+    code: Schema.tag(\\\"rate-limited\\\"),\\n+    message: Schema.tag(\\n+      \\\"Too many calculations were sent. Wait a minute before trying again.\\\"\\n+    ),\\n+    retry: Schema.tag(\\\"wait-then-try-manually\\\"),\\n+  }\\n+) {}\\n+\\n+export class CalculatorAdmissionUnavailable extends Schema.TaggedError<CalculatorAdmissionUnavailable>()(\\n+  \\\"CalculatorAdmissionUnavailable\\\",\\n+  {\\n+    code: Schema.tag(\\\"calculation-admission-unavailable\\\"),\\n+    message: Schema.tag(\\n+      \\\"The calculation could not be started. Try again when you are ready.\\\"\\n+    ),\\n+    retry: Schema.tag(\\\"try-again-manually\\\"),\\n+  }\\n+) {}\\n+\\n+export const CalculatorRequestError = Schema.Union([\\n@@\\n export const CalculatorServiceError = Schema.Union([\\n   CalculatorRequestError,\\n+  CalculatorRateLimited,\\n+  CalculatorAdmissionUnavailable,\\n*** Add File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/packages/calculators/src/admission.schemas.ts\\n+import { Schema } from \\\"effect\\\";\\n+\\n+// This identity belongs only to anonymous work admission. It cannot be\\n+// serialised as a report, RPC payload, telemetry value or visitor identifier.\\n+export const CalculatorClientRateKey = Schema.RedactedFromValue(\\n+  Schema.IpAddressFromString.pipe(\\n+    Schema.brand(\\\"@taxkit/calculators/CalculatorClientRateKey\\\")\\n+  ),\\n+  { disallowEncode: true, label: \\\"CalculatorClientRateKey\\\" }\\n+);\\n+export type CalculatorClientRateKey = typeof CalculatorClientRateKey.Type;\\n*** Add File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/packages/calculators/src/admission.service.ts\\n+import { Context, Option } from \\\"effect\\\";\\n+import type { Effect } from \\\"effect\\\";\\n+\\n+import type { CalculatorClientRateKey } from \\\"./admission.schemas.js\\\";\\n+import type {\\n+  CalculatorAdmissionUnavailable,\\n+  CalculatorRateLimited,\\n+} from \\\"./schemas.js\\\";\\n+\\n+export const CalculatorRequestRateKey = Context.Reference<\\n+  Option.Option<CalculatorClientRateKey>\\n+>(\\\"@taxkit/calculators/CalculatorRequestRateKey\\\", {\\n+  defaultValue: Option.none,\\n+});\\n+\\n+export class CalculatorAdmission extends Context.Service<\\n+  CalculatorAdmission,\\n+  {\\n+    readonly admitCalculation: (\\n+      key: CalculatorClientRateKey\\n+    ) => Effect.Effect<void, CalculatorRateLimited | CalculatorAdmissionUnavailable>;\\n+  }\\n+>()(\\\"@taxkit/calculators/CalculatorAdmission\\\") {}\\n*** Add File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/packages/calculators/src/admission.layer.ts\\n+import { Effect, Layer, Option } from \\\"effect\\\";\\n+\\n+import {\\n+  CalculatorAdmission,\\n+  CalculatorRequestRateKey,\\n+} from \\\"./admission.service.js\\\";\\n+import { CalculatorAdmissionUnavailable } from \\\"./schemas.js\\\";\\n+import { PublicCalculatorService } from \\\"./service.js\\\";\\n+\\n+// The native host builds this once below its existing work/time bound. Direct\\n+// engine and local SDK callers keep the original calculator implementation.\\n+export const PublicCalculatorServiceRateLimited = Layer.effect(\\n+  PublicCalculatorService,\\n+  Effect.gen(function* () {\\n+    const calculator = yield* PublicCalculatorService;\\n+    const admission = yield* CalculatorAdmission;\\n+    return PublicCalculatorService.of({\\n+      ...calculator,\\n+      calculate: Effect.fn(\\\"PublicCalculatorService.calculateAdmitted\\\")(\\n+        (request) =>\\n+          CalculatorRequestRateKey.pipe(\\n+            Effect.flatMap(\\n+              Option.match({\\n+                onNone: () => Effect.fail(new CalculatorAdmissionUnavailable()),\\n+                onSome: admission.admitCalculation,\\n+              })\\n+            ),\\n+            Effect.andThen(Effect.suspend(() => calculator.calculate(request)))\\n+          )\\n+      ),\\n+    });\\n+  })\\n+);\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\np=Path('packages/calculators/package.json'); d=json.loads(p.read_text())\\nfor part in ['admission.schemas','admission.service','admission.layer']:\\n d['exports']['./'+part]={'source':'./src/'+part+'.ts','types':'./dist/'+part+'.d.ts','default':'./dist/'+part+'.js'}\\n d['publishConfig']['exports']['./'+part]={'types':'./dist/'+part+'.d.ts','default':'./dist/'+part+'.js'}\\np.write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\np=Path('packages/calculators/src/index.ts');s=p.read_text().replace('  CalculatorCapacityExceeded,','  CalculatorCapacityExceeded,\\\\n  CalculatorRateLimited,\\\\n  CalculatorAdmissionUnavailable,',1);p.write_text(s)\\nPY\",max_output_tokens:500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10fab-f789-7f30-a7de-963ccee8ae9f","create_time":1791264658.932485}}}
