{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T05:46:04.574Z","ordinal":38893,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a10fab-f789-7f30-a7de-963ccee8ae9f","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac48b1ad22487d0a7cb69e4bae153a7","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The source tests pass. They show that HTTP and private calls share the 60-calculation allowance, each batch member uses a unit, and metadata uses none. The generated HTTP client also receives the checked 429 error with `Retry-After: 60`.\n\nThe built-host tests are next. Those will check the actual native binding and website forwarding.\n"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1791265562864,"completed_at_ms":1791265564574}}
