s\":[{\"sid\":\"API_PUBLIC_ORIGIN\",\"data\":{\"bindings\":[{\"type\":\"self_url\",\"name\":\"API_PUBLIC_ORIGIN\"}]}},{\"sid\":\"CALCULATOR_HOST_MODE\",\"data\":{\"bindings\":[{\"type\":\"plain_text\",\"name\":\"CALCULATOR_HOST_MODE\",\"text\":\"edge\"}]}},{\"sid\":\"CALCULATOR_RATE_LIMIT\",\"data\":{\"bindings\":[{\"type\":\"ratelimit\",\"name\":\"CALCULATOR_RATE_LIMIT\",\"namespaceId\":\"10076\",\"simple\":{\"limit\":60,\"period\":60}}]}},{\"sid\":\"WEBSITE_PUBLIC_ORIGIN\",\"data\":{\"bindings\":[null]}}]}\n46:@taxkit/infrastructure test: [16:57:04.187] ERROR (#480): Error [AssertionError]: expected [ 'CALCULATOR_HOST_MODE', …(3) ] to deeply equal [ 'API_PUBLIC_ORIGIN', …(2) ]\n50:@taxkit/infrastructure test:     'CALCULATOR_HOST_MODE',\n55:@taxkit/infrastructure test:   expected: [ 'API_PUBLIC_ORIGIN', 'TAXKIT_API', 'WEBSITE_PUBLIC_ORIGIN' ],\n69:@taxkit/infrastructure test:  FAIL  src/apps-stack.test.ts > native paired app graph and planner > keeps the actual circular address graph live for create\n70:@taxkit/infrastructure test:  FAIL  src/apps-stack.test.ts > native paired app graph and planner > keeps the actual circular address graph live for update\n71:@taxkit/infrastructure test: AssertionError: expected [ 'CALCULATOR_HOST_MODE', …(3) ] to deeply equal [ 'API_PUBLIC_ORIGIN', …(2) ]\n77:@taxkit/infrastructure test: +   \"CALCULATOR_HOST_MODE\",\n101:@taxkit/infrastructure test:  FAIL  src/apps-stack.test.ts > native paired app graph and planner > keeps the actual circular address graph live for noop\n102:@taxkit/infrastructure test: AssertionError: expected [ { action: 'noop', …(1) }, …(1) ] to deeply equal [ { action: 'noop', …(1) }, …(1) ]\n"},"started_at_ms":1791266397367,"completed_at_ms":1791266397367}}
