rl: Output<string | undefined, never>; }, never, Providers | State | StackServices>' with 'exactOptionalPropertyTypes: true'. Consider adding 'undefined' to the types of the target's properties.\n@taxkit/infrastructure check-types:   Type 'Providers | RuntimeContext | Scope' is not assignable to type 'Providers | State | StackServices'.\n@taxkit/infrastructure check-types:     Type 'RuntimeContext' is not assignable to type 'Providers | State | StackServices'.\n@taxkit/infrastructure check-types:       Type 'Shape<\"RuntimeContext\", BaseRuntimeContext>' is not assignable to type 'Stack'.\n@taxkit/infrastructure check-types:         Type '\"RuntimeContext\"' is not assignable to type '\"Stack\"'.\n@taxkit/infrastructure check-types: src/apps-stack.test.ts(87,6): error TS377004: This Effect requires a service that is missing from the expected Effect context: `RuntimeContext`. effect(missingEffectContext)\n@taxkit/infrastructure check-types: src/apps-stack.test.ts(175,16): warning TS377136: `effect/http/HttpClient#layerMergedContext` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\n@taxkit/infrastructure check-types: src/apps-stack.test.ts(177,20): warning TS377136: `effect/http/HttpClient#make` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\n@taxkit/infrastructure check-types: Exited with code 1\n\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"{\"stage\": \"web-types\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"--filter=web\", \"check-types\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 1.02, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev75-rate-v26-web-types.log\"}\n{\"stage\": \"infra-types\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"--filter=@taxkit/infrastructure\", \"check-types\"], \"exitCode\": 1, \"durationSeconds\": 0.51, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev75-rate-v26-infra-types.log\"}\n@taxkit/infrastructure check-types: src/apps-stack.test.ts(87,6): error TS2379: Argument of type 'Effect<{ apiUrl: Output<string | undefined, ne