cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git status --short; git log -1 --format='%H %s'; cat > /private/tmp/dev75-rate-pr-body.md <<'EOF'\nWebsite and API calculations now share the native API's allowance of 60 calculations per minute per checked connection address. Each batch calculation uses one unit. A rejected calculation returns fixed guidance to retry manually; missing identity or an unavailable limiter fails safely. Metadata requests use no units.\n\nThe website carries its checked address through a private service binding. HTTP returns 429 with Retry-After 60, and RPC revision 4 and the SDK expose the same canonical errors. Cloudflare's limiter is approximate and local to a location. The native API requires an operator-selected CALCULATOR_RATE_NAMESPACE; local emulation uses an isolated explicit value.\n\nValidation: all nine ordered local release checks passed, including full repository verification, 11 built-native cases, 534 lint-policy cases, 32 workflow cases, browser checks and genuine packed SDK consumers. Two deliberate implementation removals failed their native tests, then restored exactly. Tax sources, retained expectations, lockfile and four rendered screenshots are unchanged. Evidence: docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-06-shared-rate-admission.json.\n\nThis completes local CSF-T004/DEV-75 work on top of draft #152. Metrics work remains deferred. No merge, deployment, publication or provider change is included; real edge identity and account namespace settings need separate authorised readback. Cancelling a private call stops local waiting; remote work remains bounded by the API's existing deadline.\nEOF"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"d39a16ec3f9e5f4ffac8068169f8b6931adbb5ed Share native calculation limits across API and website\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"d39a16ec3f9e5f4ffac8068169f8b6931adbb5ed Share native calculation limits across API and website\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":7083},"formatted_output":"d39a16ec3f9e5f4ffac8068169f8b6931adbb5ed Share native calculation limits across API and website\n"},"started_at_ms":1791272303065,"completed_at_ms":1791272303065}}
