{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T07:40:40.505Z","ordinal":40509,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a10fab-f789-7f30-a7de-963ccee8ae9f","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-8b9f25fd-7417-4e0d-a288-0c89bdf6a1b8","server":"executor-personal","tool":"execute","arguments":{"code":"const out=[]; for(const [name,args] of [['get_project',{query:'Taxkit',includeResources:true}],['get_issue',{id:'DEV-75',includeRelations:true}],['get_issue',{id:'DEV-76',includeRelations:true}],['get_issue',{id:'DEV-80',includeRelations:true}],['list_issue_statuses',{team:'Development'}],['list_comments',{issueId:'e9824311-b9a1-44af-a163-d36d1ad340f6',limit:100,orderBy:'createdAt'}]]){const result=await tools['linear_mcp.user.personallinearmcp.'+name](args);out.push({name,args,result});if(!result.ok) break;} return out;","maxOutputChars":35000},"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"get_project\",\n    \"args\": {\n      \"query\": \"Taxkit\",\n      \"includeResources\": true\n    },\n    \"result\": {\n      \"ok\": true,\n      \"data\": {\n        \"_meta\": {\n          \"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo\": {\n            \"name\": \"Linear MCP\",\n            \"title\": \"Linear\",\n            \"icons\": [\n              {\n                \"src\": \"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg\",\n                \"mimeType\": \"image/svg+xml\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n            \"websiteUrl\": \"https://linear.app\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"content\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"text\",\n            \"text\": \"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"P-DEV-3\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null,\\\"color\\\":\\\"#26b5ce\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"summary\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4\\\",\\\"resourceCount\\\":1,\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-03T03:56:19.746Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-03T03:56:19.746Z\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"startDate\\\":null,\\\"startDateResolution\\\":null,\\\"targetDate\\\":null,\\\"targetDateResolution\\\":null,\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"labels\\\":[],\\\"initiatives\\\":[],\\\"lead\\\":{},\\\"leadTeam\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"key\\\":\\\"DEV\\\"},\\\"status\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"a223298c-28b9-43fa-9eed-947a2e219ac1\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"teams\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"key\\\":\\\"DEV\\\"}],\\\"resources\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"link\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"aff0f022-2859-4f55-a50f-0d0c2d37125a\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"GitHub repository\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:10:12.762Z\\\"}]}\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"get_issue\",\n    \"args\": {\n      \"id\": \"DEV-75\",\n      \"includeRelations\": true\n    },\n    \"result\": {\n      \"ok\": true,\n      \"data\": {\n        \"_meta\": {\n          \"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo\": {\n            \"name\": \"Linear MCP\",\n            \"title\": \"Linear\",\n            \"icons\": [\n              {\n                \"src\": \"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg\",\n                \"mimeType\": \"image/svg+xml\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n            \"websiteUrl\": \"https://linear.app\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"content\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"text\",\n            \"text\": \"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-75\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"e9824311-b9a1-44af-a163-d36d1ad340f6\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"This issue tracks `CSF-T004` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\\\n\\\\nVisitors need useful pages for every existing calculator, while package users need a clear new interface that preserves valid tax results.\\\\n\\\\nWork to do:\\\\n\\\\n* Build AU take-home pay, AU pay withholdings and AU annual income tax. Show the existing 2025–26 scope and the first two calculators’ PAYG-only limit.\\\\n* Use a Calculate button. Edits mark an old answer stale and cancel old work. Show the main answer with expandable breakdown, assumptions, tax year and sources; make the homepage calculator-first.\\\\n* Keep figures and reports temporary. Apply shared input/body/work/concurrency/rate limits and checked failures across website RPC and public HTTP.\\\\n* Give SDK users an explicit client lifetime they can close, plus an Effect interface. Tighten retained calculator/rule/core code to the agreed immutable style and one Schema owner without changing valid results.\\\\n* Update examples, exports, generated contracts, consumer checks and the required major-version Changesets.\\\\n\\\\nAccept when:\\\\n\\\\n* Every existing calculator works with representative valid and invalid values and preserves known valid results.\\\\n* Keyboard use, focus, result announcements, cancellation and disposal work; no figures appear in saved state, URLs or share metadata.\\\\n* Packed SDK consumers use public exports, close the client and pass the new interface checks.\\\\n\\\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run --filter=@taxkit/calculators test`, `bun run --filter=@taxkit/api-http test`, `bun run sdk:check-packed-artifact`, `bun run sdk:validate-downstream`, `bun run api:smoke`, `bun run test`, `bun run changeset:status`, `bun run verification`.\\\\n\\\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\\\n\\\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\\\n\\\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L362>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\\\",\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-75/csf-t004-build-all-calculator-pages-and-the-fresh-package-interface\\\",\\\"gitBranchName\\\":\\\"coopercorbett/dev-75-csf-t004-build-all-calculator-pages-and-the-fresh-package\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:13:44.048Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-06T07:38:59.698Z\\\",\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":null,\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"dueDate\\\":null,\\\"slaStartedAt\\\":null,\\\"slaMediumRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaHighRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaBreachesAt\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"statusType\\\":\\\"backlog\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"api\\\",\\\"ui\\\",\\\"frontend\\\"],\\\"attachments\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"ddec4016-09bb-4f22-ae54-a806439f6f41\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Share native calculation limits across API and website\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/154\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"40745686-181a-4c8f-8c01-53f1b6f00435\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Preserve error forms and remove unused catalogue program\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/152\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"83fbe8b8-123a-4db8-a85d-ababae2dbf48\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"refactor(calculators): own optional request values\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/151\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"2512d7fa-687f-4ea2-927c-7cd14199d3f4\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"refactor(core): own missing values and preserve domain reports\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/150\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b53bad8f-7e2f-4851-8d9f-312502c6358a\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"fix(rules): validate tax tables and keep Core builds portable\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/149\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c92fba92-693d-4258-9219-b075e8609ace\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"DEV-75: check money, decimal and calendar operations\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/148\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b8a2f523-d879-4022-ada3-242e206c52d3\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"DEV-75: derive trace and ledger types from their Schemas\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/147\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d4ee9f40-8b0d-4926-aac5-7e757fb9bdd4\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"DEV-75: protect request reads and all calculator operation budgets\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/146\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"fbc3f2ac-2464-42c8-bbf5-4656111cc5a3\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Complete nine named calculator RPC operations with shared client protections\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/145\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"0909f8ee-392a-4852-a3ef-ddcae8b43144\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Share eight calculation places and checked five-second timeouts\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/144\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"1ecebb7f-b9d0-4260-a07e-9c1881d72a92\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Bound private replies and show checked retry guidance\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/143\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"1b695d70-cd47-46e2-8b0b-8023d8543e9b\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Enforce native request size and portable test output\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/142\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"4e8a6430-4fb6-4a79-a0df-7aca657424e7\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Give each supported calculator its own working page\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/141\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"6b93c704-b82c-459b-b92e-27151497bd8f\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read the supported calculator list through the API connection\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/139\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"5d118850-24b7-4f9e-aec2-a88af3cb3dd1\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Explain each take-home answer with its recorded breakdown and sources\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/138\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"a1ac0b22-33a4-4f01-bb7c-79ba65efb445\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Keep the previous calculator answer while details change\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/137\\\"}],\\\"documents\\\":[],\\\"stateHistory\\\":[{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:13:44.048Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":null}],\\\"createdBy\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"createdById\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"assignee\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"assigneeId\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"projectId\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"team\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"teamId\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"relations\\\":{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-80\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T009 — Send safe logs, traces and metrics to the three shared Axiom datasets\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-79\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-77\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-76\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\\\"}],\\\"blockedBy\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-74\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T003 — Make one calculator work through the separate website and backend\\\"}],\\\"relatedTo\\\":[],\\\"duplicateOf\\\":null}}\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"get_issue\",\n    \"args\": {\n      \"id\": \"DEV-76\",\n      \"includeRelations\": true\n    },\n    \"result\": {\n      \"ok\": true,\n      \"data\": {\n        \"_meta\": {\n          \"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo\": {\n            \"name\": \"Linear MCP\",\n            \"title\": \"Linear\",\n            \"icons\": [\n              {\n                \"src\": \"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg\",\n                \"mimeType\": \"image/svg+xml\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n            \"websiteUrl\": \"https://linear.app\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"content\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"text\",\n            \"text\": \"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-76\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"06b0766d-6362-43ff-a9d3-08dd47ef5b41\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"This issue tracks `CSF-T005` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\\\n\\\\nThe replacement needs one reviewed source of public content so pages, search engines and agents receive the same accurate information.\\\\n\\\\nWork to do:\\\\n\\\\n* Review retained docs and navigation, accept finished pages explicitly and exclude unfinished drafts from public discovery.\\\\n* Derive page metadata, canonical URLs, sitemap, robots, structured data, search, agent indexes and processed Markdown from one accepted catalogue.\\\\n* Provide deterministic 1200×630 social share images from public page metadata. Public Markdown covers docs/reference pages; it contains no raw executable MDX or personal calculation downloads.\\\\n* Keep website rendering browser-safe. Put dynamic content/search/Markdown/image operations behind the shared backend contract; static generated assets need no extra server.\\\\n* Preserve useful old URLs and historical sources. Retire apps/docs only after the replacement works, and update build/cache/quality/release commands and documentation owners together.\\\\n\\\\nAccept when:\\\\n\\\\n* All public representations use the same accepted catalogue, with source attribution and draft exclusion.\\\\n* Actual routes, crawler-readable pages, search, Markdown and share images work on mobile and with a keyboard.\\\\n* The removed docs app has no remaining required command/path owner, while useful old links and historical evidence remain reachable.\\\\n\\\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run docs:validate`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run build`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run verification`.\\\\n\\\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`, `CSF-T004`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\\\n\\\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\\\n\\\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L425>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\\\",\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-76/csf-t005-rebuild-docs-search-discovery-public-markdown-and-share\\\",\\\"gitBranchName\\\":\\\"coopercorbett/dev-76-csf-t005-rebuild-docs-search-discovery-public-markdown-and\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:13:49.487Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:13:50.112Z\\\",\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":null,\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"dueDate\\\":null,\\\"slaStartedAt\\\":null,\\\"slaMediumRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaHighRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaBreachesAt\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"statusType\\\":\\\"backlog\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"web\\\",\\\"search\\\",\\\"docs\\\"],\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"documents\\\":[],\\\"stateHistory\\\":[{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:13:49.487Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":null}],\\\"createdBy\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"createdById\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"projectId\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"team\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"teamId\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"relations\\\":{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-79\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-78\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T007 — Prepare Alchemy domain, DNS and Doppler plans\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-77\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\\\"}],\\\"blockedBy\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-74\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T003 — Make one calculator work through the separate website and backend\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-75\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\\\"}],\\\"relatedTo\\\":[],\\\"duplicateOf\\\":null}}\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"get_issue\",\n    \"args\": {\n      \"id\": \"DEV-80\",\n      \"includeRelations\": true\n    },\n    \"result\": {\n      \"ok\": true,\n      \"data\": {\n        \"_meta\": {\n          \"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo\": {\n            \"name\": \"Linear MCP\",\n            \"title\": \"Linear\",\n            \"icons\": [\n              {\n                \"src\": \"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg\",\n                \"mimeType\": \"image/svg+xml\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n            \"websiteUrl\": \"https://linear.app\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"content\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"text\",\n            \"text\": \"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-80\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"17d02184-45d0-4203-9b86-963399b73dc3\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T009 — Send safe logs, traces and metrics to the three shared Axiom datasets\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"This issue tracks `CSF-T009` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\\\n\\\\nThe account is limited to three datasets. TaxKit needs useful operational signals in the existing datasets without changing their ownership or sending calculation details.\\\\n\\\\nWork to do:\\\\n\\\\n* Reference the existing logs/traces/metrics outputs from CooperCorbettSiteCloudflare/prod. Do not create, adopt or change the shared datasets or their retention.\\\\n* Give TaxKit its own scoped ingest token, destinations and dashboards under the reviewed Alchemy plan.\\\\n* Use common project/app/stage fields so each signal can be filtered. Implement the agreed request/calculation logs, spans, counts and durations without unbounded metric labels.\\\\n* Keep one native trace owner and bounded Effect log/metric delivery for each request, with the correct encoding, endpoint and headers.\\\\n* Test application and automatic trace fields, including URLs and retained Cloudflare storage. If native tracing cannot meet the privacy contract, record the requirement as unmet and resolve the design rather than claiming completion.\\\\n\\\\nAccept when:\\\\n\\\\n* Exactly the three existing datasets are used and their ownership/retention is unchanged.\\\\n* Actual payload, identity, encoding and completion checks pass for logs, traces and metrics.\\\\n* No input or result details leak through automatic spans or logs. Safe tracing and exact provider indexing require actual evidence, not only an application allowlist.\\\\n\\\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run verification`.\\\\n\\\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`, `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T006`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\\\n\\\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\\\n\\\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L668>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\\\",\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-80/csf-t009-send-safe-logs-traces-and-metrics-to-the-three-shared-axiom\\\",\\\"gitBranchName\\\":\\\"coopercorbett/dev-80-csf-t009-send-safe-logs-traces-and-metrics-to-the-three\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:15:37.419Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:15:52.801Z\\\",\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":null,\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"dueDate\\\":null,\\\"slaStartedAt\\\":null,\\\"slaMediumRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaHighRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaBreachesAt\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"statusType\\\":\\\"backlog\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"analytics\\\",\\\"backend\\\",\\\"infra\\\"],\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"documents\\\":[],\\\"stateHistory\\\":[{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:15:37.419Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":null}],\\\"createdBy\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"createdById\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"projectId\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"team\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"teamId\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"relations\\\":{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-81\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\\\"}],\\\"blockedBy\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-75\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-77\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-74\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T003 — Make one calculator work through the separate website and backend\\\"}],\\\"relatedTo\\\":[],\\\"duplicateOf\\\":null}}\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"list_issue_statuses\",\n    \"args\": {\n      \"team\": \"Development\"\n    },\n    \"result\": {\n      \"ok\": true,\n      \"data\": {\n        \"_meta\": {\n          \"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo\": {\n            \"name\": \"Linear MCP\",\n            \"title\": \"Linear\",\n            \"icons\": [\n              {\n                \"src\": \"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg\",\n                \"mimeType\": \"image/svg+xml\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n            \"websiteUrl\": \"https://linear.app\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"content\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"text\",\n            \"text\": \"[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"52668f1a-675e-4632-bd34-96d6f06c6c3d\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"started\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"In Review\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b878aab7-e95e-4f74-aac1-e8693ffd9fd1\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"started\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"In Progress\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b580ede9-f2d1-40eb-af6a-93c6c5b19b01\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"unstarted\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Todo\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"875c2058-7eef-419b-828c-66b623041c00\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"canceled\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Canceled\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"68bb7866-dbef-4091-a340-a84299ee2aa8\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Done\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"4252ed97-f277-460f-a358-583b6caf18fe\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"duplicate\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Duplicate\\\"}]\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"list_comments\",\n    \"args\": {\n      \"issueId\": \"e9824311-b9a1-44af-a163-d36d1ad340f6\",\n      \"limit\": 100,\n      \"orderBy\": \"createdAt\"\n    },\n    \"result\": {\n      \"ok\": true,\n      \"data\": {\n        \"_meta\": {\n          \"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo\": {\n            \"name\": \"Linear MCP\",\n            \"title\": \"Linear\",\n            \"icons\": [\n              {\n                \"src\": \"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg\",\n                \"mimeType\": \"image/svg+xml\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n            \"websiteUrl\": \"https://linear.app\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"content\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"text\",\n            \"text\": \"{\\\"comments\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"6a17034d-46f9-4450-821e-d5534c34df7c\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"DEV-75 remains active. [Draft #146](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/146), at `72c8f42041ae942ef67a1327d6dc69ab1fb6d12c`, now shares the 64 KiB request limit and five-second body deadline across public HTTP, private RPC and calculator forms. All nine calculator operations have checked five-second work limits; calculation work shares eight places per Worker instance, with no waiting queue. Metadata does not use a calculation place. Checked failures carry fixed safe guidance.\\\\n\\\\nThe corrected complete nine-stage local check run passed, including the real packed package consumer, API smoke and website/browser tests. GitHub Quality passed at this exact commit: [run 37393720058](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37393720058), completed 6 October at 00:40:15 UTC. The dated receipt retains the earlier failed test attempts and the exact local source/build observations.\\\\n\\\\nNext: finish the trace/ledger Schema-owner change, then trusted rate limiting and the wider money/date/table review. The trace/ledger candidate preserves four original encoded samples, and deliberate field-order/unchecked-input mistakes fail the real packed-consumer tests. Its complete local checks are still running. Existing tax rules and Medicare results are retained pending Cooper's separate correction decision. Nothing is merged, deployed or published, and no provider or credential change is included.\\\",\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-06T00:44:22.708Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-06T00:44:22.645Z\\\",\\\"parentId\\\":null,\\\"resolvedAt\\\":null,\\\"quotedText\\\":null,\\\"author\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\"},\\\"onBehalfOf\\\":null}],\\\"hasNextPage\\\":false}\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n]"}],"structuredContent":{"status":"completed","result":[{"name":"get_project","args":{"query":"Taxkit","includeResources":true},"result":{"ok":true,"data":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}],"version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app"}},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"P-DEV-3\",\"uuid\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"icon\":null,\"color\":\"#26b5ce\",\"name\":\"Taxkit\",\"summary\":\"\",\"description\":null,\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4\",\"resourceCount\":1,\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-03T03:56:19.746Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-03T03:56:19.746Z\",\"startedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"startDate\":null,\"startDateResolution\":null,\"targetDate\":null,\"targetDateResolution\":null,\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"labels\":[],\"initiatives\":[],\"lead\":{},\"leadTeam\":{\"id\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\",\"name\":\"Development\",\"key\":\"DEV\"},\"status\":{\"id\":\"a223298c-28b9-43fa-9eed-947a2e219ac1\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"teams\":[{\"id\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\",\"name\":\"Development\",\"key\":\"DEV\"}],\"resources\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"id\":\"aff0f022-2859-4f55-a50f-0d0c2d37125a\",\"label\":\"GitHub repository\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:10:12.762Z\"}]}"}]}}},{"name":"get_issue","args":{"id":"DEV-75","includeRelations":true},"result":{"ok":true,"data":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}],"version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app"}},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"DEV-75\",\"uuid\":\"e9824311-b9a1-44af-a163-d36d1ad340f6\",\"title\":\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\",\"description\":\"This issue tracks `CSF-T004` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\n\\nVisitors need useful pages for every existing calculator, while package users need a clear new interface that preserves valid tax results.\\n\\nWork to do:\\n\\n* Build AU take-home pay, AU pay withholdings and AU annual income tax. Show the existing 2025–26 scope and the first two calculators’ PAYG-only limit.\\n* Use a Calculate button. Edits mark an old answer stale and cancel old work. Show the main answer with expandable breakdown, assumptions, tax year and sources; make the homepage calculator-first.\\n* Keep figures and reports temporary. Apply shared input/body/work/concurrency/rate limits and checked failures across website RPC and public HTTP.\\n* Give SDK users an explicit client lifetime they can close, plus an Effect interface. Tighten retained calculator/rule/core code to the agreed immutable style and one Schema owner without changing valid results.\\n* Update examples, exports, generated contracts, consumer checks and the required major-version Changesets.\\n\\nAccept when:\\n\\n* Every existing calculator works with representative valid and invalid values and preserves known valid results.\\n* Keyboard use, focus, result announcements, cancellation and disposal work; no figures appear in saved state, URLs or share metadata.\\n* Packed SDK consumers use public exports, close the client and pass the new interface checks.\\n\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run --filter=@taxkit/calculators test`, `bun run --filter=@taxkit/api-http test`, `bun run sdk:check-packed-artifact`, `bun run sdk:validate-downstream`, `bun run api:smoke`, `bun run test`, `bun run changeset:status`, `bun run verification`.\\n\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\n\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\n\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L362>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-75/csf-t004-build-all-calculator-pages-and-the-fresh-package-interface\",\"gitBranchName\":\"coopercorbett/dev-75-csf-t004-build-all-calculator-pages-and-the-fresh-package\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:13:44.048Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-06T07:38:59.698Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"api\",\"ui\",\"frontend\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"ddec4016-09bb-4f22-ae54-a806439f6f41\",\"title\":\"Share native calculation limits across API and website\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/154\"},{\"id\":\"40745686-181a-4c8f-8c01-53f1b6f00435\",\"title\":\"Preserve error forms and remove unused catalogue program\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/152\"},{\"id\":\"83fbe8b8-123a-4db8-a85d-ababae2dbf48\",\"title\":\"refactor(calculators): own optional request values\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/151\"},{\"id\":\"2512d7fa-687f-4ea2-927c-7cd14199d3f4\",\"title\":\"refactor(core): own missing values and preserve domain reports\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/150\"},{\"id\":\"b53bad8f-7e2f-4851-8d9f-312502c6358a\",\"title\":\"fix(rules): validate tax tables and keep Core builds portable\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/149\"},{\"id\":\"c92fba92-693d-4258-9219-b075e8609ace\",\"title\":\"DEV-75: check money, decimal and calendar operations\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/148\"},{\"id\":\"b8a2f523-d879-4022-ada3-242e206c52d3\",\"title\":\"DEV-75: derive trace and ledger types from their Schemas\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/147\"},{\"id\":\"d4ee9f40-8b0d-4926-aac5-7e757fb9bdd4\",\"title\":\"DEV-75: protect request reads and all calculator operation budgets\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/146\"},{\"id\":\"fbc3f2ac-2464-42c8-bbf5-4656111cc5a3\",\"title\":\"Complete nine named calculator RPC operations with shared client protections\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/145\"},{\"id\":\"0909f8ee-392a-4852-a3ef-ddcae8b43144\",\"title\":\"Share eight calculation places and checked five-second timeouts\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/144\"},{\"id\":\"1ecebb7f-b9d0-4260-a07e-9c1881d72a92\",\"title\":\"Bound private replies and show checked retry guidance\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/143\"},{\"id\":\"1b695d70-cd47-46e2-8b0b-8023d8543e9b\",\"title\":\"Enforce native request size and portable test output\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/142\"},{\"id\":\"4e8a6430-4fb6-4a79-a0df-7aca657424e7\",\"title\":\"Give each supported calculator its own working page\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/141\"},{\"id\":\"6b93c704-b82c-459b-b92e-27151497bd8f\",\"title\":\"Read the supported calculator list through the API connection\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/139\"},{\"id\":\"5d118850-24b7-4f9e-aec2-a88af3cb3dd1\",\"title\":\"Explain each take-home answer with its recorded breakdown and sources\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/138\"},{\"id\":\"a1ac0b22-33a4-4f01-bb7c-79ba65efb445\",\"title\":\"Keep the previous calculator answer while details change\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/137\"}],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:13:44.048Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"createdById\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"assignee\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"assigneeId\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"project\":\"Taxkit\",\"projectId\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"team\":\"Development\",\"teamId\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-80\",\"title\":\"CSF-T009 — Send safe logs, traces and metrics to the three shared Axiom datasets\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-79\",\"title\":\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-77\",\"title\":\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-76\",\"title\":\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\"}],\"blockedBy\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-74\",\"title\":\"CSF-T003 — Make one calculator work through the separate website and backend\"}],\"relatedTo\":[],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"}]}}},{"name":"get_issue","args":{"id":"DEV-76","includeRelations":true},"result":{"ok":true,"data":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}],"version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app"}},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"DEV-76\",\"uuid\":\"06b0766d-6362-43ff-a9d3-08dd47ef5b41\",\"title\":\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\",\"description\":\"This issue tracks `CSF-T005` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\n\\nThe replacement needs one reviewed source of public content so pages, search engines and agents receive the same accurate information.\\n\\nWork to do:\\n\\n* Review retained docs and navigation, accept finished pages explicitly and exclude unfinished drafts from public discovery.\\n* Derive page metadata, canonical URLs, sitemap, robots, structured data, search, agent indexes and processed Markdown from one accepted catalogue.\\n* Provide deterministic 1200×630 social share images from public page metadata. Public Markdown covers docs/reference pages; it contains no raw executable MDX or personal calculation downloads.\\n* Keep website rendering browser-safe. Put dynamic content/search/Markdown/image operations behind the shared backend contract; static generated assets need no extra server.\\n* Preserve useful old URLs and historical sources. Retire apps/docs only after the replacement works, and update build/cache/quality/release commands and documentation owners together.\\n\\nAccept when:\\n\\n* All public representations use the same accepted catalogue, with source attribution and draft exclusion.\\n* Actual routes, crawler-readable pages, search, Markdown and share images work on mobile and with a keyboard.\\n* The removed docs app has no remaining required command/path owner, while useful old links and historical evidence remain reachable.\\n\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run docs:validate`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run build`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run verification`.\\n\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`, `CSF-T004`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\n\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\n\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L425>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-76/csf-t005-rebuild-docs-search-discovery-public-markdown-and-share\",\"gitBranchName\":\"coopercorbett/dev-76-csf-t005-rebuild-docs-search-discovery-public-markdown-and\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:13:49.487Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:13:50.112Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"web\",\"search\",\"docs\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:13:49.487Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"createdById\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"project\":\"Taxkit\",\"projectId\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"team\":\"Development\",\"teamId\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-79\",\"title\":\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-78\",\"title\":\"CSF-T007 — Prepare Alchemy domain, DNS and Doppler plans\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-77\",\"title\":\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\"}],\"blockedBy\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-74\",\"title\":\"CSF-T003 — Make one calculator work through the separate website and backend\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-75\",\"title\":\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\"}],\"relatedTo\":[],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"}]}}},{"name":"get_issue","args":{"id":"DEV-80","includeRelations":true},"result":{"ok":true,"data":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}],"version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app"}},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"DEV-80\",\"uuid\":\"17d02184-45d0-4203-9b86-963399b73dc3\",\"title\":\"CSF-T009 — Send safe logs, traces and metrics to the three shared Axiom datasets\",\"description\":\"This issue tracks `CSF-T009` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\n\\nThe account is limited to three datasets. TaxKit needs useful operational signals in the existing datasets without changing their ownership or sending calculation details.\\n\\nWork to do:\\n\\n* Reference the existing logs/traces/metrics outputs from CooperCorbettSiteCloudflare/prod. Do not create, adopt or change the shared datasets or their retention.\\n* Give TaxKit its own scoped ingest token, destinations and dashboards under the reviewed Alchemy plan.\\n* Use common project/app/stage fields so each signal can be filtered. Implement the agreed request/calculation logs, spans, counts and durations without unbounded metric labels.\\n* Keep one native trace owner and bounded Effect log/metric delivery for each request, with the correct encoding, endpoint and headers.\\n* Test application and automatic trace fields, including URLs and retained Cloudflare storage. If native tracing cannot meet the privacy contract, record the requirement as unmet and resolve the design rather than claiming completion.\\n\\nAccept when:\\n\\n* Exactly the three existing datasets are used and their ownership/retention is unchanged.\\n* Actual payload, identity, encoding and completion checks pass for logs, traces and metrics.\\n* No input or result details leak through automatic spans or logs. Safe tracing and exact provider indexing require actual evidence, not only an application allowlist.\\n\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run verification`.\\n\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`, `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T006`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\n\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\n\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L668>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-80/csf-t009-send-safe-logs-traces-and-metrics-to-the-three-shared-axiom\",\"gitBranchName\":\"coopercorbett/dev-80-csf-t009-send-safe-logs-traces-and-metrics-to-the-three\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:15:37.419Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:15:52.801Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"analytics\",\"backend\",\"infra\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:15:37.419Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"createdById\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"project\":\"Taxkit\",\"projectId\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"team\":\"Development\",\"teamId\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-81\",\"title\":\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\"}],\"blockedBy\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-75\",\"title\":\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-77\",\"title\":\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-74\",\"title\":\"CSF-T003 — Make one calculator work through the separate website and backend\"}],\"relatedTo\":[],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"}]}}},{"name":"list_issue_statuses","args":{"team":"Development"},"result":{"ok":true,"data":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}],"version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app"}},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[{\"id\":\"52668f1a-675e-4632-bd34-96d6f06c6c3d\",\"type\":\"started\",\"name\":\"In Review\"},{\"id\":\"b878aab7-e95e-4f74-aac1-e8693ffd9fd1\",\"type\":\"started\",\"name\":\"In Progress\"},{\"id\":\"b580ede9-f2d1-40eb-af6a-93c6c5b19b01\",\"type\":\"unstarted\",\"name\":\"Todo\"},{\"id\":\"875c2058-7eef-419b-828c-66b623041c00\",\"type\":\"canceled\",\"name\":\"Canceled\"},{\"id\":\"68bb7866-dbef-4091-a340-a84299ee2aa8\",\"type\":\"completed\",\"name\":\"Done\"},{\"id\":\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\",\"type\":\"backlog\",\"name\":\"Backlog\"},{\"id\":\"4252ed97-f277-460f-a358-583b6caf18fe\",\"type\":\"duplicate\",\"name\":\"Duplicate\"}]"}]}}},{"name":"list_comments","args":{"issueId":"e9824311-b9a1-44af-a163-d36d1ad340f6","limit":100,"orderBy":"createdAt"},"result":{"ok":true,"data":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}],"version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app"}},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"6a17034d-46f9-4450-821e-d5534c34df7c\",\"body\":\"DEV-75 remains active. [Draft #146](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/146), at `72c8f42041ae942ef67a1327d6dc69ab1fb6d12c`, now shares the 64 KiB request limit and five-second body deadline across public HTTP, private RPC and calculator forms. All nine calculator operations have checked five-second work limits; calculation work shares eight places per Worker instance, with no waiting queue. Metadata does not use a calculation place. Checked failures carry fixed safe guidance.\\n\\nThe corrected complete nine-stage local check run passed, including the real packed package consumer, API smoke and website/browser tests. GitHub Quality passed at this exact commit: [run 37393720058](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37393720058), completed 6 October at 00:40:15 UTC. The dated receipt retains the earlier failed test attempts and the exact local source/build observations.\\n\\nNext: finish the trace/ledger Schema-owner change, then trusted rate limiting and the wider money/date/table review. The trace/ledger candidate preserves four original encoded samples, and deliberate field-order/unchecked-input mistakes fail the real packed-consumer tests. Its complete local checks are still running. Existing tax rules and Medicare results are retained pending Cooper's separate correction decision. Nothing is merged, deployed or published, and no provider or credential change is included.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-06T00:44:22.708Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-06T00:44:22.645Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null}],\"hasNextPage\":false}"}]}}}],"logs":[]}},"duration":{"secs":3,"nanos":997245125}},"started_at_ms":1791272436507,"completed_at_ms":1791272440505}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T07:40:40.591Z","ordinal":40510,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a11028-530f-73f0-8c0d-7b8238d5d0e7","call_id":"call_ZDijcamzwvGFeNzRc3vyNCvr","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"status\":\"completed\",\"result\":[{\"name\":\"get_project\",\"args\":{\"query\":\"Taxkit\",\"includeResources\":true},\"result\":{\"ok\":true,\"data\":{\"_meta\":{\"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo\":{\"name\":\"Linear MCP\",\"title\":\"Linear\",\"icons\":[{\"src\":\"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg\",\"mimeType\":\"image/svg+xml\"}],\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"websiteUrl\":\"https://linear.app\"}},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"P-DEV-3\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null,\\\"color\\\":\\\"#26b5ce\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"summary\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4\\\",\\\"resourceCount\\\":1,\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-03T03:56:19.746Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-03T03:56:19.746Z\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"startDate\\\":null,\\\"startDateResolution\\\":null,\\\"targetDate\\\":null,\\\"targetDateResolution\\\":null,\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"labels\\\":[],\\\"initiatives\\\":[],\\\"lead\\\":{},\\\"leadTeam\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"key\\\":\\\"DEV\\\"},\\\"status\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"a223298c-28b9-43fa-9eed-947a2e219ac1\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"teams\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"key\\\":\\\"DEV\\\"}],\\\"resources\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"link\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"aff0f022-2859-4f55-a50f-0d0c2d37125a\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"GitHub repository\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:10:12.762Z\\\"}]}\"}]}}},{\"name\":\"get_issue\",\"args\":{\"id\":\"DEV-75\",\"includeRelations\":true},\"result\":{\"ok\":true,\"data\":{\"_meta\":{\"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo\":{\"name\":\"Linear MCP\",\"title\":\"Linear\",\"icons\":[{\"src\":\"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg\",\"mimeType\":\"image/svg+xml\"}],\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"websiteUrl\":\"https://linear.app\"}},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-75\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"e9824311-b9a1-44af-a163-d36d1ad340f6\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"This issue tracks `CSF-T004` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\\\n\\\\nVisitors need useful pages for every existing calculator, while package users need a clear new interface that preserves valid tax results.\\\\n\\\\nWork to do:\\\\n\\\\n* Build AU take-home pay, AU pay withholdings and AU annual income tax. Show the existing 2025–26 scope and the first two calculators’ PAYG-only limit.\\\\n* Use a Calculate button. Edits mark an old answer stale and cancel old work. Show the main answer with expandable breakdown, assumptions, tax year and sources; make the homepage calculator-first.\\\\n* Keep figures and reports temporary. Apply shared input/body/work/concurrency/rate limits and checked failures across website RPC and public HTTP.\\\\n* Give SDK users an explicit client lifetime they can close, plus an Effect interface. Tighten retained calculator/rule/core code to the agreed immutable style and one Schema owner without changing valid results.\\\\n* Update examples, exports, generated contracts, consumer checks and the required major-version Changesets.\\\\n\\\\nAccept when:\\\\n\\\\n* Every existing calculator works with representative valid and invalid values and preserves known valid results.\\\\n* Keyboard use, focus, result announcements, cancellation and disposal work; no figures appear in saved state, URLs or share metadata.\\\\n* Packed SDK consumers use public exports, close the client and pass the new interface checks.\\\\n\\\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run --filter=@taxkit/calculators test`, `bun run --filter=@taxkit/api-http test`, `bun run sdk:check-packed-artifact`, `bun run sdk:validate-downstream`, `bun run api:smoke`, `bun run test`, `bun run changeset:status`, `bun run verification`.\\\\n\\\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\\\n\\\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\\\n\\\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L362>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\\\",\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-75/csf-t004-build-all-calculator-pages-and-the-fresh-package-interface\\\",\\\"gitBranchName\\\":\\\"coopercorbett/dev-75-csf-t004-build-all-calculator-pages-and-the-fresh-package\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:13:44.048Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-06T07:38:59.698Z\\\",\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":null,\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"dueDate\\\":null,\\\"slaStartedAt\\\":null,\\\"slaMediumRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaHighRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaBreachesAt\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"statusType\\\":\\\"backlog\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"api\\\",\\\"ui\\\",\\\"frontend\\\"],\\\"attachments\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"ddec4016-09bb-4f22-ae54-a806439f6f41\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Share native calculation limits across API and website\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/154\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"40745686-181a-4c8f-8c01-53f1b6f00435\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Preserve error forms and remove unused catalogue program\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/152\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"83fbe8b8-123a-4db8-a85d-ababae2dbf48\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"refactor(calculators): own optional request values\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/151\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"2512d7fa-687f-4ea2-927c-7cd14199d3f4\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"refactor(core): own missing values and preserve domain reports\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/150\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b53bad8f-7e2f-4851-8d9f-312502c6358a\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"fix(rules): validate tax tables and keep Core builds portable\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/149\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c92fba92-693d-4258-9219-b075e8609ace\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"DEV-75: check money, decimal and calendar operations\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/148\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b8a2f523-d879-4022-ada3-242e206c52d3\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"DEV-75: derive trace and ledger types from their Schemas\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/147\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d4ee9f40-8b0d-4926-aac5-7e757fb9bdd4\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"DEV-75: protect request reads and all calculator operation budgets\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/146\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"fbc3f2ac-2464-42c8-bbf5-4656111cc5a3\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Complete nine named calculator RPC operations with shared client protections\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/145\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"0909f8ee-392a-4852-a3ef-ddcae8b43144\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Share eight calculation places and checked five-second timeouts\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/144\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"1ecebb7f-b9d0-4260-a07e-9c1881d72a92\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Bound private replies and show checked retry guidance\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/143\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"1b695d70-cd47-46e2-8b0b-8023d8543e9b\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Enforce native request size and portable test output\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/142\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"4e8a6430-4fb6-4a79-a0df-7aca657424e7\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Give each supported calculator its own working page\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/141\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"6b93c704-b82c-459b-b92e-27151497bd8f\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read the supported calculator list through the API connection\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/139\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"5d118850-24b7-4f9e-aec2-a88af3cb3dd1\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Explain each take-home answer with its recorded breakdown and sources\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/138\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"a1ac0b22-33a4-4f01-bb7c-79ba65efb445\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Keep the previous calculator answer while details change\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/137\\\"}],\\\"documents\\\":[],\\\"stateHistory\\\":[{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:13:44.048Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":null}],\\\"createdBy\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"createdById\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"assignee\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"assigneeId\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"projectId\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"team\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"teamId\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"relations\\\":{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-80\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T009 — Send safe logs, traces and metrics to the three shared Axiom datasets\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-79\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-77\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-76\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\\\"}],\\\"blockedBy\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-74\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T003 — Make one calculator work through the separate website and backend\\\"}],\\\"relatedTo\\\":[],\\\"duplicateOf\\\":null}}\"}]}}},{\"name\":\"get_issue\",\"args\":{\"id\":\"DEV-76\",\"includeRelations\":true},\"result\":{\"ok\":true,\"data\":{\"_meta\":{\"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo\":{\"name\":\"Linear MCP\",\"title\":\"Linear\",\"icons\":[{\"src\":\"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg\",\"mimeType\":\"image/svg+xml\"}],\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"websiteUrl\":\"https://linear.app\"}},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-76\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"06b0766d-6362-43ff-a9d3-08dd47ef5b41\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"This issue tracks `CSF-T005` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\\\n\\\\nThe replacement needs one reviewed source of public content so pages, search engines and agents receive the same accurate information.\\\\n\\\\nWork to do:\\\\n\\\\n* Review retained docs and navigation, accept finished pages explicitly and exclude unfinished drafts from public discovery.\\\\n* Derive page metadata, canonical URLs, sitemap, robots, structured data, search, agent indexes and processed Markdown from one accepted catalogue.\\\\n* Provide deterministic 1200×630 social share images from public page metadata. Public Markdown covers docs/reference pages; it contains no raw executable MDX or personal calculation downloads.\\\\n* Keep website rendering browser-safe. Put dynamic content/search/Markdown/image operations behind the shared backend contract; static generated assets need no extra server.\\\\n* Preserve useful old URLs and historical sources. Retire apps/docs only after the replacement works, and update build/cache/quality/release commands and documentation owners together.\\\\n\\\\nAccept when:\\\\n\\\\n* All public representations use the same accepted catalogue, with source attribution and draft exclusion.\\\\n* Actual routes, crawler-readable pages, search, Markdown and share images work on mobile and with a keyboard.\\\\n* The removed docs app has no remaining required command/path owner, while useful old links and historical evidence remain reachable.\\\\n\\\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run docs:validate`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run build`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run verification`.\\\\n\\\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`, `CSF-T004`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\\\n\\\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\\\n\\\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L425>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\\\",\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-76/csf-t005-rebuild-docs-search-discovery-public-markdown-and-share\\\",\\\"gitBranchName\\\":\\\"coopercorbett/dev-76-csf-t005-rebuild-docs-search-discovery-public-markdown-and\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:13:49.487Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:13:50.112Z\\\",\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":null,\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"dueDate\\\":null,\\\"slaStartedAt\\\":null,\\\"slaMediumRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaHighRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaBreachesAt\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"statusType\\\":\\\"backlog\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"web\\\",\\\"search\\\",\\\"docs\\\"],\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"documents\\\":[],\\\"stateHistory\\\":[{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:13:49.487Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":null}],\\\"createdBy\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"createdById\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"projectId\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"team\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"teamId\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"relations\\\":{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-79\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-78\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T007 — Prepare Alchemy domain, DNS and Doppler plans\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-77\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\\\"}],\\\"blockedBy\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-74\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T003 — Make one calculator work through the separate website and backend\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-75\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\\\"}],\\\"relatedTo\\\":[],\\\"duplicateOf\\\":null}}\"}]}}},{\"name\":\"get_issue\",\"args\":{\"id\":\"DEV-80\",\"includeRelations\":true},\"result\":{\"ok\":true,\"data\":{\"_meta\":{\"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo\":{\"name\":\"Linear MCP\",\"title\":\"Linear\",\"icons\":[{\"src\":\"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg\",\"mimeType\":\"image/svg+xml\"}],\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"websiteUrl\":\"https://linear.app\"}},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-80\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"17d02184-45d0-4203-9b86-963399b73dc3\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T009 — Send safe logs, traces and metrics to the three shared Axiom datasets\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"This issue tracks `CSF-T009` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\\\n\\\\nThe account is limited to three datasets. TaxKit needs useful operational signals in the existing datasets without changing their ownership or sending calculation details.\\\\n\\\\nWork to do:\\\\n\\\\n* Reference the existing logs/traces/metrics outputs from CooperCorbettSiteCloudflare/prod. Do not create, adopt or change the shared datasets or their retention.\\\\n* Give TaxKit its own scoped ingest token, destinations and dashboards under the reviewed Alchemy plan.\\\\n* Use common project/app/stage fields so each signal can be filtered. Implement the agreed request/calculation logs, spans, counts and durations without unbounded metric labels.\\\\n* Keep one native trace owner and bounded Effect log/metric delivery for each request, with the correct encoding, endpoint and headers.\\\\n* Test application and automatic trace fields, including URLs and retained Cloudflare storage. If native tracing cannot meet the privacy contract, record the requirement as unmet and resolve the design rather than claiming completion.\\\\n\\\\nAccept when:\\\\n\\\\n* Exactly the three existing datasets are used and their ownership/retention is unchanged.\\\\n* Actual payload, identity, encoding and completion checks pass for logs, traces and metrics.\\\\n* No input or result details leak through automatic spans or logs. Safe tracing and exact provider indexing require actual evidence, not only an application allowlist.\\\\n\\\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run verification`.\\\\n\\\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`, `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T006`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\\\n\\\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\\\n\\\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L668>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\\\",\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-80/csf-t009-send-safe-logs-traces-and-metrics-to-the-three-shared-axiom\\\",\\\"gitBranchName\\\":\\\"coopercorbett/dev-80-csf-t009-send-safe-logs-traces-and-metrics-to-the-three\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:15:37.419Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:15:52.801Z\\\",\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":null,\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"dueDate\\\":null,\\\"slaStartedAt\\\":null,\\\"slaMediumRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaHighRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaBreachesAt\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"statusType\\\":\\\"backlog\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"analytics\\\",\\\"backend\\\",\\\"infra\\\"],\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"documents\\\":[],\\\"stateHistory\\\":[{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:15:37.419Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":null}],\\\"createdBy\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"createdById\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"projectId\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"team\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"teamId\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"relations\\\":{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-81\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\\\"}],\\\"blockedBy\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-75\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-77\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-74\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T003 — Make one calculator work through the separate website and backend\\\"}],\\\"relatedTo\\\":[],\\\"duplicateOf\\\":null}}\"}]}}},{\"name\":\"list_issue_statuses\",\"args\":{\"team\":\"Development\"},\"result\":{\"ok\":true,\"data\":{\"_meta\":{\"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo\":{\"name\":\"Linear MCP\",\"title\":\"Linear\",\"icons\":[{\"src\":\"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg\",\"mimeType\":\"image/svg+xml\"}],\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"websiteUrl\":\"https://linear.app\"}},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"52668f1a-675e-4632-bd34-96d6f06c6c3d\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"started\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"In Review\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b878aab7-e95e-4f74-aac1-e8693ffd9fd1\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"started\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"In Progress\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b580ede9-f2d1-40eb-af6a-93c6c5b19b01\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"unstarted\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Todo\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"875c2058-7eef-419b-828c-66b623041c00\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"canceled\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Canceled\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"68bb7866-dbef-4091-a340-a84299ee2aa8\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Done\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"4252ed97-f277-460f-a358-583b6caf18fe\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"duplicate\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Duplicate\\\"}]\"}]}}},{\"name\":\"list_comments\",\"args\":{\"issueId\":\"e9824311-b9a1-44af-a163-d36d1ad340f6\",\"limit\":100,\"orderBy\":\"createdAt\"},\"result\":{\"ok\":true,\"data\":{\"_meta\":{\"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo\":{\"name\":\"Linear MCP\",\"title\":\"Linear\",\"icons\":[{\"src\":\"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg\",\"mimeType\":\"image/svg+xml\"}],\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"websiteUrl\":\"https://linear.app\"}},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"comments\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"6a17034d-46f9-4450-821e-d5534c34df7c\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"DEV-75 remains active. [Draft #146](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/146), at `72c8f42041ae942ef67a1327d6dc69ab1fb6d12c`, now shares the 64 KiB request limit and five-second body deadline across public HTTP, private RPC and calculator forms. All nine calculator operations have checked five-second work limits; calculation work shares eight places per Worker instance, with no waiting queue. Metadata does not use a calculation place. Checked failures carry fixed safe guidance.\\\\n\\\\nThe corrected complete nine-stage local check run passed, including the real packed package consumer, API smoke and website/browser tests. GitHub Quality passed at this exact commit: [run 37393720058](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37393720058), completed 6 October at 00:40:15 UTC. The dated receipt retains the earlier failed test attempts and the exact local source/build observations.\\\\n\\\\nNext: finish the trace/ledger Schema-owner change, then trusted rate limiting and the wider money/date/table review. The trace/ledger candidate preserves four original encoded samples, and deliberate field-order/unchecked-input mistakes fail the real packed-consumer tests. Its complete local checks are still running. Existing tax rules and Medicare results are retained pending Cooper's separate correction decision. Nothing is merged, deployed or published, and no provider or credential change is included.\\\",\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-06T00:44:22.708Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-06T00:44:22.645Z\\\",\\\"parentId\\\":null,\\\"resolvedAt\\\":null,\\\"quotedText\\\":null,\\\"author\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\"},\\\"onBehalfOf\\\":null}],\\\"hasNextPage\\\":false}\"}]}}}],\"logs\":[]}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10fab-f789-7f30-a7de-963ccee8ae9f","create_time":1791272440.591028}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
