{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T07:49:51.196Z","ordinal":40630,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a11030-b9dc-74a1-af72-0da1bc9ce966","call_id":"call_NFryUpBzRm3xrrVIxPQOuC3y","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"8d74c1\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.002618459,\"session_id\":65923,\"original_token_count\":0,\"output\":\"\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Internal Error ()\nciteturn29view0 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://fumadocs.dev/docs/mdx/bun\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 1\nL0: URL https://fumadocs.dev/docs/mdx/bun is not accessible via this tool.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nVite | Fumadocs (https://fumadocs.dev/docs/mdx/vite)\nciteturn29view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://fumadocs.dev/docs/mdx/vite\",\"lineno\":null}); Redirected to URL: https://www.fumadocs.dev/docs/mdx/vite; Total lines: 118\nL0: cite0†Fumadocs L1: \nL2: Search\nL3: \nL4: `⌘``K`\nL5: \nL6: Guide\nL7: \nL8: cite1†Getting Started cite2†Performance L9: \nL10: cite3†Accessing Collections L11: \nL12: cite4†Macro API L13: \nL14: Integrations\nL15: \nL16: cite5†Next.js cite6†Vite L17: \nL18: cite7†Runtime Loader L19: \nL20: Configuration\nL21: \nL22: cite8†Collections cite9†Global Options cite10†MDX Presets L23: \nL24: Features\nL25: \nL26: cite11†Include cite12†Last Modified Time cite13†Lazy Loading cite14†Generate Types cite15†Workspace L27: \nL28: On this page\nL29: \nL30: Ask AI\nL31: \nL32: # Vite\nL33: \nL34: Use Fumadocs MDX with Vite\nL35: \nL36: Copy Markdown Open\nL37: \nL38: ## cite16†Setup Copy Anchor Link\nL39: ### cite17†Installation Copy Anchor Link\nL40: \nL41: npm\nL42: \nL43: pnpm\nL44: \nL45: yarn\nL46: \nL47: bun\nL48: \nL49: Copy Text\nL50: \nL51:     `npm i fumadocs-mdx fumadocs-core @types/mdx`\nL52: \nL53: Add the Vite plugin:\nL54: \nL55: Vite\nL56: \nL57: Waku\nL58: \nL59: vite.config.ts\nL60: \nL61: Copy Text\nL62: \nL63:     `import { defineConfig } from 'vite';\nL64:     import { fumadocsMdx } from 'fumadocs-mdx/vite';\nL65: \nL66:     export default defineConfig({\nL67:       plugins: [\nL68:         fumadocsMdx(),\nL69:         // ...\nL70:       ],\nL71:     });`\nL72: ### cite18†Integrate with Fumadocs Copy Anchor Link\nL73: \nL74: Create a `lib/source.ts` file:\nL75: \nL76: app/lib/source.ts\nL77: \nL78: Copy Text\nL79: \nL80:     `import { defineDocs } from 'fumadocs-mdx/macro';\nL81:     import { loader } from 'fumadocs-core/source';\nL82: \nL83:     const docs = defineDocs({\nL84:       dir: 'content/docs',\nL85:     });\nL86: \nL87:     export const source = loader({\nL88:       baseUrl: '/docs',\nL89:       source: docs.toFumadocsSource(),\nL90:     });`\nL91: \nL92: ### cite19†Done Copy Anchor Link\nL93: \nL94: You can now write content in `content/docs` folder.\nL95: ## cite20†What is Next? Copy Anchor Link\nL96: \nL97: cite4†Macro API Define collections in your app modules with `fumadocs-mdx/macro`. cite8†Config API Define collections in `source.config.ts` with generated entry files. cite13†Lazy Loading Hit performance bottleneck? You can try lazy loading. L98: \nL99: How is this guide?\nL100: \nL101: Good Bad\nL102: \nL103: Last updated on\nL104: \nL105: cite5†Previous PageNext.js cite7†Next PageRuntime Loader L106: ### On this page\nL107: \nL108: cite16†Setup cite17†Installation cite18†Integrate with Fumadocs cite19†Done cite20†What is Next? L109: \nL110: cite21†Sponsors†fuma-nama.dev L111: \nL112: cite22†General Translation†generaltranslation.com cite23†Ferry Health†github.com cite24†assistant-ui†assistant-ui.com cite25†Inkeep†inkeep.com L113: \nL114: cite22†General Translation†generaltranslation.com cite23†Ferry Health†github.co